    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Activates the Entrance Animation upon the character's entry*\n- {passiveImg:once}ATK 150%{passiveImg:up_g} and guards all attacks for 6 turns\n*Basic effect(s)*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 40%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional Super Attack\n- All allies' Ki +1 and DEF 40%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- ATK & DEF 30%{passiveImg:up_g}, chance of performing a critical hit 20%{passiveImg:up_g} and\nchance of evading enemy's attack 10%{passiveImg:up_g} for allies whose names\ninclude \"Gamma 2\"\n*When attacking with 12 or more Ki*\n- ATK 100%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*For every attack received*\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 100%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 200%)\n- {passiveImg:forever}Damage reduction rate 10%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 20%)\n*After receiving 4 attacks in battle*\n- {passiveImg:forever}Great chance of performing a critical hit\n- {passiveImg:once}Foresees enemy's Super Attack for 2 turns from the\ncharacter's next attacking turn\n*When receiving an Unarmed Super Attack*\n- Great chance of nullifying it and countering with tremendous power\n- Nullifies it and counters with tremendous power starting from the\n5th turn from the character's entry turn",
